{"cause":"Approved domain-memory retrieval records expose a target reference but the Notebook has no server-owned default target registry, no atomic application boundary, and no immutable provenance record.","cause_status":"known","event_id":"d6e2cc8f-784a-4a13-80ab-bf6cc0385b77","event_sha256":"3dda49d0506e93b8d98f6c23ddf54b27d5e6c093831c11adab96e6ec0898501f","evidence":{"kind":"pytest","observed_at":"2026-08-01T06:18:30.000Z","ref":"tests/test_memory_integration_context.py: ModuleNotFoundError for workbench.agent.notebook.memory_defaults","sha256":"fcb9bb7d80d282c400b776d127dc850738222acd7e300ffea4b70a54a19c7b54"},"impact":"suggest_default cannot alter a typed Draft safely and a default that did change would have no user-visible immutable source.","incident_id":"d6e2cc8f-784a-4a13-80ab-bf6cc0385b77","lesson":"Memory target references must resolve through a server registry to an exact validated value; compact natural-language lessons must never be parsed as executable defaults.","lesson_key":"memory-default-target-registry-before-application","links":["backend/workbench/agent/notebook/memory_defaults.py","backend/workbench/agent/notebook/proposal.py","tests/test_memory_integration_context.py"],"prev_event_sha256":"8f8c0056ec2ff869e122074c1dd12c7700cc9ed1773f5bf440ab58cb34e5882b","preventability":"not_preventable","resolution":"accepted","schema_version":1,"stage":"implementation","subtype":"tdd_red_before_memory_default_application","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:18:30.000Z","type":"FAILURE"}
