{"cause":"The domain-memory runtime has no nonblocking preflight collector or gate integration, so approved memory validity is invisible between retrievals.","cause_status":"known","event_id":"7af9609e-e191-4bc5-ae26-73f5f637e7fd","event_sha256":"61b1f28eaff181de4bd323197e3f6ad60edd4ec2505c3d4f425036231f6b656b","evidence":{"kind":"pytest","observed_at":"2026-08-01T06:31:00.000Z","ref":"tests/test_memory_integration_context.py: ModuleNotFoundError for workbench.domain_memory.preflight","sha256":"7be0c55bc1f197086f6cb79e3d94d3f4600e3047e075af10b41706d2c34c6ea5"},"impact":"A stale or expiring approved memory can be safely omitted at runtime but remains invisible in developer and CI gate output.","incident_id":"7af9609e-e191-4bc5-ae26-73f5f637e7fd","lesson":"Runtime omission and gate visibility are separate controls; a nonblocking preflight needs its own tested collector.","lesson_key":"tdd-domain-memory-preflight-before-gate-wiring","links":["backend/workbench/domain_memory/preflight.py","scripts/gate.sh","tests/test_memory_integration_context.py","tests/test_gate_script.py"],"prev_event_sha256":"f24e9fa320d0e6cde617ffb44204c0a7abc1adbc1c5adf5c9054b710740014df","preventability":"not_preventable","resolution":"accepted","schema_version":1,"stage":"implementation","subtype":"tdd_red_before_domain_memory_gate_preflight","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:31:00.000Z","type":"FAILURE"}
{"cause":"The individual revalidation path used dataclasses.replace on the prior v1.3 revision, so it retained old memory_default_sources even when the new typed proposal carried none.","cause_status":"known","event_id":"4bf2f223-27a3-42ed-878c-173beaaedbf5","event_sha256":"a1cfd64c878d28395d1786abb025bc5cd2cb72fc0004a791bcdf7c7ea099542a","evidence":{"kind":"pytest","observed_at":"2026-08-01T06:38:00.000Z","ref":"tests/test_memory_integration_context.py: v1.3 source remained after source-free revalidation","sha256":"c0c6d8f940404ad4ec4acda4f6d9c4ed6489d2d30a01f9bc7234862acc576e21"},"impact":"A revalidated Draft could display provenance that did not belong to its current typed proposal.","incident_id":"4bf2f223-27a3-42ed-878c-173beaaedbf5","lesson":"A revision version that encodes provenance must be selected from the new proposal, never inherited solely from the prior revision class.","lesson_key":"memory-provenance-version-from-new-proposal-on-revalidation","links":["backend/workbench/agent/notebook/service.py","tests/test_memory_integration_context.py"],"prev_event_sha256":"61b1f28eaff181de4bd323197e3f6ad60edd4ec2505c3d4f425036231f6b656b","preventability":"preventable","resolution":"resolved","schema_version":1,"stage":"implementation","subtype":"memory_default_provenance_survives_revalidation_without_source","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:38:00.000Z","type":"FAILURE"}
